  "headline": "Britain former prince Andrew received payment alleged to be bribe for Turkish heiress",
  "label": "NEWS",
  "caption": "A British former royal faces a high profile court appearance after allegations of taking a large payment. 💰\n\nAccording to the High Court in London, Britain's former prince Andrew received $976,000 as an alleged bribe to help a Turkish heiress.\n\nAccording to legal submissions, the claim emerged at the start of a four month civil trial between Nebahat Isbilen and her former adviser Selman Turk.\n\nIsbilen alleges Turk misappropriated her funds, while Turk claims the payment to the former prince was a gift made in the hope of getting assistance for her jailed husband.\n\nAccording to reports, Andrew is due to give evidence at the trial and is not accused of wrongdoing in the case.\n\nWould you follow a trial like this involving royalty? 👇\n\nFollow Vok for more stories like this.\n\n#Vok #VokOriginals #PrinceAndrew #UKNews #HighCourt\n\n📸 York Minster / Wikimedia Commons (CC BY-SA 2.0)",
